  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSEasyPeteTopic000",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Was a prospector until I decided to settle here to get away from the NCR. Now I just take it easy and help out with the Brahmin and Bighorners.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "Why are you called Easy Pete?"
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSEasyPeteTopic001",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "The one in the fancy suit seemed to be calling the shots, that's as much as I know. Other folks in town might know more. {TEXT IS CORRECT, NOT SOUND FILE.}",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Word of advice, though: if you ever catch up with him, watch out. The man's got cold eyes like a snake. Can't be trusted, I'd say.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "Do you know anything about the people who attacked me?"
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSEasyPeteTopic002",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Meat and hide, mostly. Can't put a pack on 'em - they just lay down until you take it off.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Can find a bunch of wild ones high up in the hills, but gotta be careful around 'em. They can put up a decent fight if cornered.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "What do you use the Bighorners for?"
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSEasyPeteTopic003",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Nope. Had a pretty good claim once, way out east by the river, but got run off by Raiders. Eventually, got too old to keep going out.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "Did you ever find anything good while prospecting?"
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSEasyPeteTopic004",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "The machine? Harmless, no matter what Trudy says. She thinks it's hiding something, but I think it's just a broken down relic with no place to be.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "Do you know anything about Victor?"
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSEasyPeteTopic005",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Yup.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "Never mind."
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSEasyPeteTopic006",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Nah, nah - means I poked through old buildings looking for working tech and such. Some folks just call it \"salvaging,\" but never liked the term.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Way I see it, salvage means it's broken, near-worthless. Me, I looked for the good stuff - guns, chems, spare parts. Good money in it.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "You were a prospector - like digging for gold and silver?"
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSEasyPeteTopic007",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Don't get me wrong - the NCR's got a lot of decent folk in it. It's just that they make you part of them whether you like it or not.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Towns like Goodsprings and Primm don't stay independent for long, not if you've got something the NCR wants. Still, the NCR keeps the Legion away.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "What's wrong with the NCR?"
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSEasyPeteTopic008",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "They're slavers, led by a guy named {SEE-zer} Caesar. Or {less certainly, KAI-zar} Caesar. Not sure how you're supposed to say it.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "A couple of years ago they tried to take over Hoover Dam, but the NCR beat them back. The NCR didn't - or couldn't - finish the job, though.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "The Legion's got its strength back and is getting ready for another round at the Dam. My money's still on the NCR winning, but you never know.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "{warning} We've been hearing stories about Legionaries on the Nevada side of the river, so keep a gun handy. You don't want to get caught by them.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "Tell me about the Legion."
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSEasyPeteTopic009",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "The Dam powers a lot of New Vegas. And then there's all that clean water lying in Lake Mead, too. Anybody who owns the Dam owns the territory.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "What's so important about Hoover Dam?"
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGoodspringsEasyPeteTopic000",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Too dangerous. Gonna kill all yourselves if I let you touch it. Better to leave it buried - safer that way.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Told you before - it's too dangerous for a bunch of amateurs to handle.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "I hear you've got dynamite. It would help us beat the powder gangers."
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGoodspringsEasyPeteTopic001",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "[SUCCEEDED] Uh huh. Guess you know what you're doing. I'll go dig it up and get it ready. You'll have it by the time the fighting starts.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "I'm familiar with the care and handling of explosives, dynamite included."
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGoodspringsEasyPeteTopic002",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "[FAILED] Too dangerous, sorry. Blow yourself up, blow your neighbor up, blow the whole town up.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "How hard can it be? Just light them and throw."
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGoodspringsEasyPeteTopic003",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Bad trouble.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "What do you know about Joe Cobb?"
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGoodspringsEasyPeteTopic004",
